ormation about the quality of healthcare: response of the US public</article-title><source>Qual Health Care</source><year>2001</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>96</fpage><lpage>103</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11389318</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/qhc.10.2.96</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>